{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get in touch via studio@emergo-entertainment.de!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Passengers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your passengers so everyone is happy. Happy passengers will give a gracious tip for you to buy new modules for your train while unhappy passengers will eventually leave out of frustration. Once three passengers left, it\u2019s game over; so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.poster.avif?t=1771988859\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.webm?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.mp4?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish your Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your train car with seats, a snack machine, a bar or even a music corner! Trains don\u2019t have to be boring and your passengers will demand the most fun ride they can get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1aac6e0119ee7f530c124169d55b0d9b.poster.avif?t=1771988859\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1aac6e0119ee7f530c124169d55b0d9b.webm?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1aac6e0119ee7f530c124169d55b0d9b.mp4?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy and Unlock Modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your train at each stop making it more accommodating for passengers. The shop lets you purchase new modules from the money you received. Finishing a run will unlock new modules you can use to complete harder routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/7fc68d5c5115579cede6e1e893f31583.poster.avif?t=1771988859\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/7fc68d5c5115579cede6e1e893f31583.webm?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/7fc68d5c5115579cede6e1e893f31583.mp4?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel Europe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the playtest, you\u2019ll be travelling our home region of Bavaria. However, the final game will include much of Europe. Maybe you\u2019ll even find a cool town for your next holiday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.poster.avif?t=1771988859\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.webm?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.mp4?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Jumble is still in active development! So we're always looking for feedback &amp; ideas! Join our Discord server to discuss the game and hang out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411360?t=1771988859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771988859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/6e1ce4b46d20a9b605bbdeb40492f779caef41ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771988859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/6e1ce4b46d20a9b605bbdeb40492f779caef41ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771988859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3679560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get in touch via studio@emergo-entertainment.de!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Passengers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your passengers so everyone is happy. Happy passengers will give a gracious tip for you to buy new modules for your train while unhappy passengers will eventually leave out of frustration. Once three passengers left, it\u2019s game over; so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.poster.avif?t=1771988859\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai