9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/7fc68d5c5115579cede6e1e893f31583.mp4?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel Europe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the playtest, you\u2019ll be travelling our home region of Bavaria. However, the final game will include much of Europe. Maybe you\u2019ll even find a cool town for your next holiday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.poster.avif?t=1771988859\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.webm?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.mp4?t=1771988859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Jumble is still in active development! So we're always looking for feedback &amp; ideas! Join our Discord server to discuss the game and hang out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Emergo Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/48283f00ead1f0f38cc07dc0e85c31946e9c8afb/header.jpg?t=1771988859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https